# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the window-WY probe's card step (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN (the tag numbers are the driver's, on the
# allowlist). Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the card is resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# NON-EXACT RESEARCH PROBE (docs/gdn-wy-probe.md): no verdict of this job licenses serving, and the window form is never in a serving or traffic profile.
# ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-wy-probe-1 is a PLACEHOLDER the driver substitutes with the combined window's fresh tag; the harness mounts this checkout's scripts, so any
# current C2 image carries the runtime it needs and no build is specific to this probe.
# W0: FILLER, listed last and run only if the window has time and scripts/ci/gdn_wy_block.py exists (REQUIRES-FILE in ORDER.txt). One card, a 1x1 mesh, four users at the four-card
# geometry: the raw-page selftest and the timing of A (one K5-A launch) and A2 (two, the sequential cost of a 32-row block), no W arm, 10 minutes. It adds nothing W2 does not measure
# (W2 times A, A2, W1 and W2 in one trace) and nothing the repo does not already hold (K5-A is ~193 us a window, measured, gdn_seq_block_split.py), so it never runs without the kernel.
# Its verdict is NO-DECISION (exit 4) by design: read the timing, not the verdict. W0 does not gate W1 or W2 and nothing waits on it.
# Duration (estimate): 10 min (container timeout 2 h; a hang trips the per-call watchdog, exit 3, then reset the target card only).
# Read: 'GDN_WY verdict=NO-DECISION scope=reduced kernel=present causality=not-run' with a_us near 193 and a2_us near twice it; a section error is reported as data, not a stop.
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-wy-probe-1
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/wy_probe/run_card_m.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--sections selftest,timing --timing-arms A,A2
C2_CARDM_ENV=IMAGE_TAG=tp4-wy-probe-1
